💻 Our stack: Kotlin (most of the codebase), Java, JavaScript, TypeScript • AOSP, Android TV, SoC vendor SDKs • Jetpack Compose, Compose for TV, Room, Leanback, D-pad navigation, React Native • repo, Soong/Android.bp • Binder, permissions model, system APIs • TV Input Framework, HDMI-CEC, MediaSession, Media3/ExoPlayer
